OL,3,AAutism, ADHD and mental health review:
OL,4,AWhat you need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been called a "generational
OL,7,Fopportunity" to rethink support for
OL,8,Fboth mental health conditions and ADHD
OL,9,Fand autism.
OL,11,FThe review, commissioned by then-health
OL,12,Fsecretary Wes Streeting 10 months ago
OL,13,Fafter saying young people were being
OL,14,F"over-diagnosed" and "written off",
OL,15,Fcould have major implications for NHS
OL,16,Fservices, the benefits system, schools
OL,17,Fand employment support.
OL,19,FIts 600-plus pages contain a host of
OL,20,Fconclusions and recommendations. Here
OL,21,Fare the key takeaways.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
