OL,3,AAutism, ADHD and mental health review:
OL,4,AWhat you need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report is clear that there is an
OL,7,Fincreasing risk of over-diagnosis, but
OL,8,Fonly when it comes to ADHD and autism.
